Emojiful for Horizon 26.3 (version 0.4.0)

A port of Emojiful 4.2.0 (Fabric 1.20.1) by HorizonStudio / Innovative Online Industries.
Original source: https://github.com/InnovativeOnlineIndustries/Emojiful
Original licence: MIT

Ported to Horizon by lavoide: the rules are re-implemented in Rust on Horizon's mod API (no Java
code is included). This port's code is distributed under the same licence as the original (MIT);
the licence text, from the original repository, is in LICENSE. Built against Horizon's exact-build
SDK dd67b76ff23e28c6d8e21859df600d31572f81a0.

Emoji graphics (assets/emojiful/textures/font/emoji_*.png): Twemoji, Copyright 2020 Twitter, Inc
and other contributors, and jdecked/twemoji contributors, licensed under CC-BY 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/; full text in LICENSE-GRAPHICS). Taken from
iamcal/emoji-data's sheet_twitter_32_clean.png (https://github.com/iamcal/emoji-data, MIT). The
images are cut into font sheets by tools/emojiful_port.py; they are otherwise unchanged. The emoji
short names come from iamcal/emoji-data's emoji.json (MIT, Copyright (c) 2013 Cal Henderson).
